"You cannot speak draconic.

"
E
"say"
"@GYou take a deep breath, square your shoulders, and speak the draconic word

for \"Fear\".@n

"
E
"rsay"
"@G$n squares $s shoulders and speaks a single word.@n

"
E
"open1"
