palatte on which is drawn incomprehensible, unspeakable images that paralyze

you with their frightening intensity.@n

"
E
"open2"
"@rThe darkness is torn away, replaced by the overwhelming terror all prey feel

moments before the snapping jaws of a predator prematurely end its life.@n

"
E
"open"
"@rThe feeling fades, leaving you drained and tired.  The blackened door to the

west has been opened.@n

