#87036
"Dragon Hatchery"
"This room holds the spawns for some of the non-static pops in the area.


NOTE: Please do not idle in this room as there are acodes in the area which

examine its contents.


Warning!!! - This room contains acodes the entire zone uses.  Do not screw it up!


-----------------------------------------------------------------

 500 - Topaz   , 564 - Onyx   , 565 - Jade      , 580 - Sapphire

 581 - Hematite, 583 - Kunzite, 585 - Bloodstone, 592 - Sunstone

